        "text": "Kuch Aur Qur'ani Jama ke Alfaaz (Jama Muannath Saalim — Suffix ات)",
        "title": "Kuch Aur Qur'ani Jama ke Alfaaz (Jama Muannath Saalim — Suffix ات)",
