      "type": "rule_paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "Yeh alfaaz yaad kar lein. Alfaaz ke aakhir mein (ات) unhe doosre jama ke alfaaz se alag karta hai aur yeh Qur'an-e-Majeed mein bahut kasrat se aate hain.",
        "content": "Yeh alfaaz yaad kar lein. Alfaaz ke aakhir mein (ات) unhe doosre jama ke alfaaz se alag karta hai aur yeh Qur'an-e-Majeed mein bahut kasrat se aate hain.",
        "hinglish_text": "Yeh alfaaz yaad kar lein. Alfaaz ke aakhir mein (ات) unhe doosre jama ke alfaaz se alag karta hai aur yeh Qur'an-e-Majeed mein bahut kasrat se aate hain."
      }
