    {
      "id": "sec_s1l11_r5",
      "type": "rule_paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "Agar yeh jama ke alfaaz (الـ) se shuru na hon toh unke aakhiri harf par tanween aayegi. Jaise (الْآيَاتُ) se (آيَاتٌ). Tamam alfaaz ko shuru mein (الـ) ke baghair padh kar exercise kijiye.",
        "content": "Agar yeh jama ke alfaaz (الـ) se shuru na hon toh unke aakhiri harf par tanween aayegi. Jaise (الْآيَاتُ) se (آيَاتٌ). Tamam alfaaz ko shuru mein (الـ) ke baghair padh kar exercise kijiye.",
        "hinglish_text": "Agar yeh jama ke alfaaz (الـ) se shuru na hon toh unke aakhiri harf par tanween aayegi. Jaise (الْآيَاتُ) se (آيَاتٌ). Tamam alfaaz ko shuru mein (الـ) ke baghair padh kar exercise kijiye."
